		"actions": {},
		"description": "<p>Few in the whole world can match the breadth of your knowledge and training. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your Dexterity, Wisdom, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li>\n<li>You gain proficiency with a skill or tool of your choice.</li>\n<li>You gain three skill specialties of your choice for skills you are proficient in. They do not count against your skill specialties known.</li>\n<li>You learn two spells of the <em>utility </em>school of a level you can cast up to 5th as bard spells. They do not count against your spells known.</li>\n</ul>",
